  "name": "Question 5",
  "problem": "Which of the following are zero matrices?\n\n$$\nH=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0\\end{aligned}],\\,I=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 0 \\\\ 0.1 & 0.1 \\\\ 0 & 0\\end{aligned}],\\,G=[\\begin{aligned}0\\end{aligned}]\n$$",
  "worked_solution": "- $H$ is a zero matrix since *all* its entries are zeros.\n\n- $I$ is *not* a zero matrix since some of its entries are not zeros (for instance, ${i}_{12}=0.1\\ne 0$).\n\n- $G$ is a zero matrix since *all* its entries are zeros.\n\nTherefore, only $H$ and $G$ are zero matrices.",
